  "inShort": "The available evidence does not establish an openable second island, so the checkpoint goal was missed. Nothing was shown this sprint, so what got done is unknown. Both tasks are marked done, but the playable result and five-player feedback remain unverified.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvun9raq00oacsz8jou1fesn",
      "text": "Playtest notes from five players on the tide loop is marked done. The inspected attachment opens a Wikipedia article about Godot, not player feedback. That mismatch leaves the tide loop untested by the evidence without changing the task’s recorded status."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvun9rb700obcsz8vrh1ina5",
      "text": "A greybox build of the second island is marked done with an attachment. No inspection result establishes that it opens a playable second island. Nothing new this sprint closes that evidence gap."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [],
  "questions": [],
  "lenses": {
    "marketing": "No public devlog supplied an audience response to assess through applause or views; no store page or game link is listed.",
    "team": "Hours are unknown, and zero work confirmations do not establish zero work or a pace. The founder joined after the checkpoint ended, so membership does not establish who carried these tasks during it.",
    "management": "Both tasks are marked done, but their evidence does not establish the 28-day goal or a proven core. The required prototype devlog is also absent, so the stage remains incomplete; next checkpoint, publish it with an openable second-island build and the five-player notes."
  }
}

